## Positive Validation

The controlled test produced:

```text
Remote Network Logon
        |
        | <= 600 seconds
        v
PowerShell
```

on the same endpoint.

The final correlation logic identified the sequence.

```text
Positive Validation:
PASS
```

---

## Negative Validation Model

CORR-002 is designed not to trigger when:

```text
Remote network logon occurs without subsequent PowerShell
```

or:

```text
PowerShell occurs without a preceding remote network logon
```

or:

```text
The activities occur on different endpoints
```

or:

```text
The elapsed time exceeds 600 seconds
```

---

## False Positive Considerations

Potential legitimate sequences include:

```text
Remote IT Administration
        |
        v
PowerShell Troubleshooting
```

```text
Helpdesk Remote Session
        |
        v
PowerShell Diagnostics
```

```text
Configuration Management
        |
        v
PowerShell Automation
```

CORR-002 therefore represents a high-value investigative signal rather than proof of compromise.

